  "details": "Ever since I've updated to 2020.1.1 in steam, my voice is audible to others, however with all settings maxed out on windows 10, on viveport, steam vr and vrchat, I am still unable to communicate with others like I did previously. It shouldnt be a hardware problem as nothing has changed since I have updated. It's really made my life hell. Anyone else having these problems? The only way I can really talk to people is if they're standing in my personal space, or the world doesnt have background sounds, or I suppose If Im not competing with loud people in the pug/cat/drinking night etc. ",
